		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Elixir R</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Borrow Actions now, pay them back next turn.</em></p><p><strong>1/Safe Rest · Free Action.</strong> Regain all expended Actions. You lose an equal number of Actions on your next turn.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> You no longer lose any Actions.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> When Dying, your STR DC to use an Action is 8.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps and the gadget's 1/Safe Rest use — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Spends Elixir R's 1/Safe Rest use.</em></p><p><em>[M] Restore your spent Actions.</em></p>",
